      "label": "Bringing the idea to life",
      "type": "spatial",
      "layout": "living-field",
      "extentWU": 3.1,
      "mobileExtentWU": 2.85,
      "text": {
        "cues": [
          {
            "id": "life-momentum",
            "text": "As those ways of thinking begin to influence one another, complexity starts to cohere.",
            "enter": 0,
            "hold": 0.08,
            "exit": 0.16,
            "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
            "motion": {
              "mode": "spatial"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "life-form",
            "text": "It takes on clear form and intuitive behaviour.",
            "enter": 0.2,
            "hold": 0.28,
            "exit": 0.36,
            "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
            "motion": {
              "mode": "spatial"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "life-character",
            "text": "It gains a character people can trust.",
            "enter": 0.4,
            "hold": 0.48,
            "exit": 0.56,
            "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
            "motion": {
              "mode": "spatial"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "life-feel",
            "text": "It becomes something they can relate to, interact with and feel.",
            "enter": 0.6,
            "hold": 0.68,
            "exit": 0.76,
            "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
            "motion": {
              "mode": "spatial"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "life-meaning",
            "text": "That is what excites me about bringing an idea to life.",
